/* ===== tx6.js — Writer W6: East Texas & deepening existing cities =====
 New cities: nacogdoches, jefferson (region north, overnight).
 New recurring characters (no romance): etta (Nacogdoches), vivian (Jefferson), bento (Houston), duarte (Austin), clyde (Fort Worth).
 Each storyline has 4 stages, one per visit: S.flags.tx6_<id> = stages done, S.flags.tx6_<id>_v = visit count when last advanced.
 Dishes: chopbeef (Etta's final stage), catfish (Caddo Lake). Supply deal: Bento → imports ×0.8/0.75.
 Main-plot ties: tx6_dempsey (old cannery lawyer's note), tx6_crate (José's festival crate), tx6_water (Duarte's groundwater test), tx6_hat (Earl's hat).
*/
